    "body": "How about something like:\n\nstep 1:\n\n``` html\n<form>\n <fieldset>\n  <legend>New article</legend>\n  <textarea name=article>&lt;p>Hello world.&lt;/p></textarea>\n </fieldset>\n <p><button>Publish</button></p>\n</form>\n```\n\nstep 2:\n\n``` html\n<form>\n <fieldset>\n  <legend>New article</legend>\n  <textarea id=textarea name=article>&lt;p>Hello world.&lt;/p></textarea>\n  <div id=div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\"></div>\n  <script>\n   textarea.hidden = true;\n   div.contentEditable = true;\n   div.innerHTML = textarea.value;\n   div.oninput = (e) => {\n     textarea.value = div.innerHTML;\n   };\n  </script>\n </fieldset>\n <p><button>Publish</button></p>\n</form>\n```\n\n...with some fluffy text around it explaining it, and maybe point out that other editing features can be implemented with script also (either with `execCommand` et al or without)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
